# Checksums for the meshes in obj/ that git does not carry.
#
# The BlueROV2 set (bluerov2*.obj, cw.obj, ccw.obj) is tracked in git and so is
# not listed here — git already guarantees its integrity. What remains is out
# of band for one of two reasons: too large for git (shipwreck.obj is 275 MiB,
# past GitHub's 100 MB limit), or provenance not yet established.
#
# Of these, only off_shore_station.obj is loaded by a scenario
# (scenario/waterlinked.scn). The rest are unreferenced; bootstrap.sh verifies
# them when present but never asks for them.
#
# Verify with:   cd sim/world/data && sha256sum -c obj.sha256
# bootstrap.sh runs this automatically.

ec4077f51b301a6ea91f317e9d1d07fbd3bbf14c7459f0689ba2ee4403a0b540  obj/off_shore_station.obj
b664334fe7f5d6d29d9175f0301bab53b274247ec6566395f720bd5f8c528bae  obj/shipwreck.obj
7ee6e8f8058883addb99b67ef9eee763c8b8525eef34fb945d93b3f5e2fe9be7  obj/cliff.obj
dec57815e4c811fabaac92869177ddd1afb0ea53a1b0cedb8fd2d348013936e2  obj/br2.obj
